{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old school FPS games with a modern touch added to it, Bloodfire let's you experience the layers of hell in the most brutal, gory and satisfying way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL DIE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill. Die. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnyhop, dash and parry through an endless legion of hellspawn, all inspired by old paintings and novels. From demonic centipedes to bloodthirsty maggots, your skills will be tested to the extreme. Choose from seven unsettling arenas, all with unique play styles and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you cross the layers of hell and prove yourself worthy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In global leaderboards, or show off to your friends. Become hell's champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through countless enemies with a fluid and expanding movement system, with 3D positional audio, so that you know exactly where your next target is. Go through all the seven layers of hell, complete with unique enemies and movesets, and survive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584970?t=1757326681","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/e375e64f593493dcfa11367f3405c5b43b6dcc79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757326681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/6fa562df15b7cc997931b3dfd0d15bcba2086c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757326681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584970/6fa562df15b7cc997931b3dfd0d15bcba2086c2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757326681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains over the top violence and gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old school FPS games with a modern touch added to it, Bloodfire let's you experience the layers of hell in the most brutal, gory and satisfying way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL DIE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill. Die. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnyhop, dash and parry through an endless legion of hellspawn, all inspired by old paintings and novels. From demonic centipedes to bloodthirsty maggots, your skills will be tested to the extreme. Choose from seven unsettling arenas, all with unique play styles and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you cross the layers of hell and prove yourself worthy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In global leaderboards, or show off to your friends. Become hell's champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through countless enemies with a fluid and expanding movement system, with 3D positional audio, so that you know exactly where your next target is. Go through all the seven layers of hell, complete with unique enemies and movesets, and survive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Unquittable Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":